For Apple-platform or React Native UI review, read `.cursor/skills/apple-design/SKILL.md` and follow its process.

Route topics with `references/hig-lookup.md` relative to that skill directory. Load only the HIG pages relevant to the screen (typically 3–6 files plus the always-load set described in the skill). Cite findings as `file.md › Heading`.

This project's design system and the coordination rule in `ui-ux-skills-coordination.mdc` take precedence over generic HIG suggestions when they conflict with intentional product choices.
